iversities?":"LLMs could offer **personalized step-by-step guidance** for problems (e.g., solving integrals). They could generate practice tests adaptively or explain proofs intuitively—bridging gaps between theory and application. Schools should integrate them *responsibly*: validate errors to avoid misconceptions."},
